{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5967667b67d78f59e54a6f925132ed7221c11e2608cf92f7f69103fe53a1986d13ad9d7c679ac52f94b4304405de6370f8e60942c47d35ac39c3d107d9c779c5f5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a9bf1c43c9afcf5f3bcb90202252cde52538542f5da5af51ff50268f1d884bf104a8b2eed78e17c6ec921bb11461cbdc61b29fdf02ec0ed11cac44484c54ef4271b1c1894df5de268b44d93b3c88a1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9b38297cf55e7acf7840903669e79aaa43483797e403ca57207a9866eeef2aaf937ca9212bcbb3af515c55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6583aae39309e2c353e25be8226ae377b43ac1b4c97bcaf9df27d4e1c55361e4bd8626586679db55a266a74ebc291f8c73f8fe4d177867382fcf020c5c1e39bc4dcac46f3e0281f455f0437c484a4f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7ae64439efb5c86dd6dbe7e1da05f0ebf59f61054082348d25834d1d4a4a1336be8b8be2ae6dcfbc4820fcbcfe1f17de2826b4b084860a6487d613789e04f4976fa0a9f59cdde9f3178e6203014946\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fc4b2a12782deecc62cebf7397af1f75141713ad97983dbd49214f0c811e31c90125426149ad8225ed84106289bdbb1c71e861c77f543a6c8c5e3edbd2f30438cc719cc357d85faed4760dfc651405\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c566fc5d82b5eac4e5b1d1c74564de02d1d6351169a7f4b8dc87b645effa0faf4712940d4fae7ac420869115edc89e91bc51c21069d90e0c1769ef62cded8f322f30e1585ea06cd71c878b647eae71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3baf8cfad59e257e4bda13879520561b00d59637be6e450a112a3bf5ca2964af6cd3728a0e4a80427bc6d80b6240e4d9074ef76d13be7096d2ac7d51723ed24907081989088c3c66dfa8c9c5c76d70\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1cd43a65b32f9c4152ac141fd30c8375b40ffa266f4100ae222668c363acbe5052b98e3512ca20c698b8adab3ebbdc0bc34548ad92d3ba54ba3544d75e72eb023b0ae03232daa61923982df94131d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/03606233dbcfa9a26d9916d5e20369ca7cb84e3333c65ba9f91611d48067a306360e2ba97894fb4845cd5381fa91c8b37817bc606269beaa045ceb92fab88a7a227348dcfd4b42836beb2fe314a9df\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dab3b31ceadaefd68c1bca13947c361a415d7feb4bbc227fdcb750b621107b2e0f43ec4eda41ccd5a8f0f8f561ffcd1dc898f438d1b858bdc4e0568e5994b1faf20ff16bf6d0246a7f1e1d1ab763d0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7ffd8d97078da238fbe8656bb6f227974f9e123e6f67f24977cce8c059c9cbdcf98aa677ae88fba5be8865c15120a7d70774ca24362aaba2faed367f73a89cb2c559fc57281b065716645d3b648cf0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e4e615cfe61ba3399cf0b59e66e3164cbe07847a16fc94e5cdd3263f15cab4b324af5aa4d9350f63e69d3c03a2da5ebf251249e821dfd9ae9fae2dc199bfe603ab499b110ffdbda16d4e3140324cc1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/55cbaa4d4864e581595e4d0fb9e0683c5180f8156f7de4ab838d5e847f2ee2e5a8b8d05e8766a0ecd32dc2864feacca1a766dfd385456b93670bf2540f94afaf018ebf5cdd939050fbad6a63cbc1c7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8289b6733f47ca52c62374a207d4786712f341b875fa98c3ef5467824098a306cdcf487ee62add50e96bce937ff40cf4fa4867e1ac4ce48b2303cd1fb507606243c79ac7bc1dc62939e8f1b5dd5cd8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1ed105c2c4a5a6551ea786e15a9c4a0f460f00b7f67ab936ec8418e078ad4e9f15b86f1d53da3331d1255080fed0927d7808985ce4da53829b8ce7f4220698e196350594c5281fef56c569a3f4d0b2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/780788429478363ce4ad42528ae975f4fcab1eb4839b5eaf73bce26e4c2b688d135e9bf28542ddf6d0de23a4c1fe5176c3fb945bb045f459a3ec382aa36e776da59166b909d0b9f4b155987151b482\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/66ba3d1c6e04adc79e32693855dbdf873230e1bf585ca1db108558a26139dd5d86413fb2e94cf03a697595d96bccb62fb19a2c791099a2e0b18302f09ec36f41fdab401ab563185423dfafbe032431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d51da798214402ed64d5758c4660edc9d497fe1aa9cd3f5711587a5373109c0e1384b3200eee3b239e484706e1adbb1c829685a4d4ce3418c423a62d67199ffbb8c56f9b65dce0eb5fade3d64abf71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/439aac50dfcbd06487989809e291f37ed7767baf0abf4182482753177f11f53a6999a297290b1472fb5cfc70ca7b7758d64b7f8e60719b72327387d7fcc7dbef6a07739d1a87e03c74bd08cf200be8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
